1
00:00:02,220 --> 00:00:04,000
灯 亮起来
And we have liftoff.

2
00:00:07,079 --> 00:00:09,400
哈罗 欢迎致电未来之家
Yello? House of the future.

3
00:00:09,400 --> 00:00:10,980
菲尔 你有两整天时间可自由支配
Phil, you have two whole days to yourself.

4
00:00:10,980 --> 00:00:12,240
别告诉我你想把全部时间都用来
Please tell me you're not gonna spend them

5
00:00:12,240 --> 00:00:13,880
将家里的装置都连接到ipad上
trying to wire the house to your ipad.

6
00:00:13,880 --> 00:00:16,079
不会 因为我早已完成了
Nope, 'cause I've already done it.

7
00:00:16,920 --> 00:00:17,720
我觉得等你到家的时候
I think when you get home,

8
00:00:17,720 --> 00:00:19,980
你会惊讶地发现我们家
you're gonna be very surprised to see that this house

9
00:00:19,980 --> 00:00:22,260
有个能控制一切的大脑中枢
has an actual functioning brain in it.

10
00:00:22,980 --> 00:00:24,080
真棒 太棒了
Great. Great.

11
00:00:24,080 --> 00:00:25,220
现在出去会会朋友吧
Now go out and see some friends.

12
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:26,220
我这就出去
I'm headed out now.

13
00:00:26,260 --> 00:00:28,240
我要在殖民健身房进行第三次形体展示
I have a third showing at that colonial.

14
00:00:28,240 --> 00:00:30,560
小卡给了我一张免费入场券去他的健身房
Cam gave me a free pass to his gym.

15
00:00:30,680 --> 00:00:31,920
我 不要太亮[脑子不灵光]
I am--not too bright.

16
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:33,240
我...
I am--

17
00:00:33,240 --> 00:00:34,286
暗下来[很笨]
Dim!

18
00:00:34,400 --> 00:00:36,180
亲爱的 听听你自己在胡说些什么
Honey, if you could hear yourself.

19
00:00:36,740 --> 00:00:37,940
答应我 你会出去玩玩的
Promise me you'll go outside and play.

20
00:00:38,200 --> 00:00:38,900
我也想你哦
Miss you, too.

21
00:00:42,560 --> 00:00:44,780
菲尔·邓菲 当前时间为2025年
Phil Dunphy, this is the year 2025.

22
00:00:45,500 --> 00:00:47,820
欢迎 你是第一个踏入未来世界的人
Welcome. You're the first one here.

23
00:01:01,131 --> 00:01:02,760
我们先去玩滑水道吧
Shall we hit the waterslide first?

24
00:01:02,760 --> 00:01:03,960
我就待在房里好了
I may just sit in the room for a bit.

25
00:01:04,320 --> 00:01:05,320
拜托 别郁闷了
Ugh! Stop moping!

26
00:01:05,720 --> 00:01:07,720
你不就是没找到舞伴去参加一场傻逼舞会嘛
So you didn't get a date to one stupid dance.

27
00:01:07,740 --> 00:01:09,000
那才不是傻逼舞会
It's not one stupid dance.

28
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:10,580
那是整个舞蹈季的开场舞
It's the kickoff to the whole dance season.

29
00:01:10,880 --> 00:01:12,980
你是没听到过那些男生们的评价吧
It's like you've never heard boys talk.

30
00:01:13,500 --> 00:01:15,800
嗨 我们是来参加知识竞赛的
Hi. We are here for the academic challenge.

31
00:01:15,940 --> 00:01:16,860
登记名是邓菲
It's under "Dunphy."

32
00:01:17,540 --> 00:01:20,120
或者也可以称为"冠军归来"
or it could be under "Returning champion."

33
00:01:20,320 --> 00:01:22,140
不知道他们会不会为这类东西建档
Not sure how they file these things.

34
00:01:22,680 --> 00:01:24,640
艾丽克斯总是获胜 那很好
Alex wins things, which is great.

35
00:01:24,640 --> 00:01:27,060
但她一直给自己太大的压力
But she puts so much pressure on herself.

36
00:01:27,060 --> 00:01:30,606
我 我都有点希望她今年能输掉
I... I almost wish she would lose this year.

37
00:01:30,931 --> 00:01:32,780
再说 那样我就可以去玩滑水道
Plus, that way, I could go on the waterslide.

38
00:01:32,780 --> 00:01:35,360
那里有螺旋状水道 2秒的自由落体
It's got a corkscrew, 2-second freefall,

39
00:01:35,360 --> 00:01:36,760
在底部还有个雷达枪
And a radar gun at the bottom.

40
00:01:38,220 --> 00:01:38,880
我成了菲尔了
I'm Phil.

41
00:01:38,929 --> 00:01:41,776
不准喝小酒柜里的东西 不准看付费电视
Nothing from the minibar, and no pay-per-view.

42
00:01:41,776 --> 00:01:42,580
我们能不能至少...
Can we at least--

43
00:01:42,580 --> 00:01:44,200
不 你不能把衣服送出去烫
No, you may not send things out for pressing.

44
00:01:44,940 --> 00:01:47,000
宝贝 比赛要1小时后才开始
Honey, we have an hour until the competition.

45
00:01:47,260 --> 00:01:48,600
你想不想去一下参赛者交谊会
Do you want to go to the contestants mixer?

46
00:01:48,780 --> 00:01:50,000
不 我才懒得去教化他们
No, I don't want to humanize them.

47
00:01:50,440 --> 00:01:52,600
你敢相信这是我第一次参加犹太男孩成年礼吗
Can you believe this is my first bar mitzvah?

48
00:01:52,600 --> 00:01:55,240
你会喜欢的 我听说礼物袋里装的都是智能手机
You'll love it. I heard the gift bags have smartphones.

49
00:01:55,240 --> 00:01:57,360
犹太人出手实在太阔绰了
Jewish people are so awesome.

50
00:01:58,780 --> 00:02:01,760
天啊 你看到了吗 她对我回眸一笑
Oh, my god. Did you see that? She smiled at me.

51
00:02:01,860 --> 00:02:03,440
在舞蹈季 那样很正常啦
People get that way in dance season.

52
00:02:03,440 --> 00:02:05,858
从来没有女孩像那样对我笑过
No girl's ever smiled at me like that.

53
00:02:05,858 --> 00:02:07,660
卢克 我们必须参加那个成年礼
Luke, we have to go to that bar mitzvah.

54
00:02:07,660 --> 00:02:07,940
为什么
Why?

55
00:02:08,140 --> 00:02:09,120
我们是有缘人千里相会
There was a connection.

56
00:02:09,920 --> 00:02:11,300
我知道这听起来有些疯狂
I know this sounds crazy,

57
00:02:11,300 --> 00:02:13,420
但我觉得我的人生为这一刻等待了太久
But I feel like my whole life has led to this moment.

58
00:02:13,620 --> 00:02:14,800
你之前也说过类似的话
You made a very similar speech

59
00:02:14,800 --> 00:02:16,380
好说服我妈停下来买西班牙小油条
to get my mom to stop for those churros.

60
00:02:16,820 --> 00:02:19,160
卢克 我需要你的帮助 你比我奸诈
Luke, I need you for this. You're sneakier than I am.

61
00:02:19,240 --> 00:02:21,860
你比我会撒谎 你内心从来不会愧疚不安
You're a bigger liar. You have no moral compass.

62
00:02:21,860 --> 00:02:23,520
听着 谢谢你的诸多"夸奖"
Look, thanks for all the compliments,

63
00:02:23,520 --> 00:02:25,560
但是要闯入一个傻逼派对
But breaking into one stupid party?

64
00:02:25,560 --> 00:02:26,700
那根本毫无挑战
That's not even a challenge.

65
00:02:29,200 --> 00:02:31,600
噢不 有3个成年礼同时举行
Oh, no. Three bar mitzvahs?

66
00:02:32,769 --> 00:02:35,118
这下有点意思了
Now it's interesting.

67
00:02:38,460 --> 00:02:39,260
小卡 停下
Cam, stop.

68
00:02:39,300 --> 00:02:40,700
怎么 我们得让他们离开屋子
What? We have to get them out of there.

69
00:02:40,740 --> 00:02:41,600
怎么磨蹭了这么久
What's taking them?

70
00:02:42,253 --> 00:02:46,080
我们为杰和歌洛莉亚的婴儿房准备了超棒的礼物
We have the most amazing gift for Jay and Gloria's nursery.

71
00:02:46,080 --> 00:02:49,000
都是小卡的主意 是个好大的秋千
It was Cam's idea, and it's a pretty big swing.

72
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:50,640
才不是秋千呢 绝对不是秋千
It's not a swing. It's not a swing.

73
00:02:50,640 --> 00:02:52,500
我只需要杰和歌洛莉亚离开屋子
I just need Jay and Gloria out of the house

74
00:02:52,500 --> 00:02:53,580
最少大约需要4小时
for a minimum of four hours

75
00:02:53,580 --> 00:02:55,060
好让我的伙计完成安装
So I can have my crew install it.

76
00:02:55,280 --> 00:02:55,520
多"简单"
Simple.

77
00:02:56,340 --> 00:02:57,320
拜托 要是听你的意见
Oh, please. If it were up to you,

78
00:02:57,320 --> 00:02:59,140
我们该送给他们那个礼品登记簿上的东西
we'd get them something off their gift registry.

79
00:02:59,280 --> 00:03:00,380
你是说那个小清单
Oh, you mean the list of things

80
00:03:00,380 --> 00:03:02,220
上面列满了他们明确说想要的东西吗
that they specifically said that they wanted?

81
00:03:02,260 --> 00:03:03,620
他们根本不知道自己想要什么
Oh, they don't know what they want.

82
00:03:04,460 --> 00:03:06,240
再按我就剁掉他的手指
...Before I snap his finger off!

83
00:03:07,915 --> 00:03:09,160
哎呀不
Ay, no.

84
00:03:09,160 --> 00:03:11,880
杰本该取消的 我们不能一起去吃午餐了
Jay was supposed to cancel. We cannot go to lunch.

85
00:03:12,060 --> 00:03:13,700
-噢不 -我很抱歉
- Oh, no. - I am sorry,

86
00:03:13,700 --> 00:03:15,800
他应该去商店把婴儿床买回来的
but he's supposed to pick up the crib at the store,

87
00:03:15,800 --> 00:03:18,900
我太累了 宝宝踢了我一整晚
And I am too tired. The baby kicked me all night.

88
00:03:18,900 --> 00:03:21,440
他要么是个橄榄球队员
It's either going to be a football player

89
00:03:21,440 --> 00:03:22,660
要么是个歌舞团姑娘
or a chorus girl.

90
00:03:22,760 --> 00:03:23,440
可以两者兼具的
You can be both.

91
00:03:23,440 --> 00:03:25,135
我高三的时候 既是右侧中后卫
My senior year, I was a right-side linebacker

92
00:03:25,135 --> 00:03:27,490
也是《金粉世界》音乐剧中的左侧康康舞选手
And a left-side cancan dancer in "Gigi."

93
00:03:27,500 --> 00:03:29,220
她真是抛砖引出你的传奇故事啊 是吧
Wow, she really set you up for that one, didn't she?

94
00:03:29,220 --> 00:03:30,060
是啊 当她说出口的时候
Yeah, when it came out of her mouth,

95
00:03:30,060 --> 00:03:30,940
我当时都快不能呼吸了
I nearly stopped breathing.

96
00:03:31,400 --> 00:03:33,160
你没打电话告诉他们要取消
You didn't call them to cancel.

97
00:03:33,280 --> 00:03:34,320
抱歉 你们要油钱吗
Sorry. You want gas money?

98
00:03:34,860 --> 00:03:35,920
别理他
Don't pay attention to him.

99
00:03:35,980 --> 00:03:37,800
他最近脾气暴得很
He's been very grumpy lately.

100
00:03:37,940 --> 00:03:38,820
好吧 不如这样
Okay, here's a thought--

101
00:03:39,020 --> 00:03:40,760
米奇尔 你和杰一起去婴儿床店
Mitchell, you go to the crib store with Jay.

102
00:03:41,020 --> 00:03:42,460
那样我能与这位美丽的女士
That way I can spend some quality time

103
00:03:42,460 --> 00:03:44,240
-共度美好时光 -不要 我要去躺会儿
- with this pretty lady. - No, I'm going to lay down.

104
00:03:44,240 --> 00:03:46,494
别别别 我要带你们娘俩儿去吃午饭
No, no, I'm gonna take you both to lunch.

105
00:03:46,760 --> 00:03:49,340
好吗 就这么定了 去涂口红 好吗
Okay? There, it's settled. Now go put a lip on. Okay?

106
00:03:49,480 --> 00:03:50,860
好吧 我猜你也不会碍事的
Fine. I guess you won't get in the way.

107
00:03:50,957 --> 00:03:53,520
说真的吗 老爸 这是真心话吗
You mean it, pa? Really and for true?

108
00:03:53,520 --> 00:03:54,600
我不会碍事
I won't get in the way?

109
00:03:56,274 --> 00:03:57,522
带个垫子真明智
Oh, that's a good idea.

110
00:03:57,522 --> 00:03:59,349
是啊 椅子硬邦邦的
Oh, yeah. The chairs are rocks.

111
00:03:59,633 --> 00:04:01,013
查理曼大帝
Charlemagne.

112
00:04:01,469 --> 00:04:03,570
可以花8美元租一天用的坐垫
You can get a 1-day cushion for $8,

113
00:04:03,570 --> 00:04:05,569
或者花12美元租两天用的
or a 2-day for $12.

114
00:04:05,569 --> 00:04:06,390
艾丽克斯·邓菲
Alex Dunphy.

115
00:04:06,390 --> 00:04:09,739
去年我租了两个一天用的 真是大错误
Last year, I got 2 1-dayers--big mistake.

116
00:04:09,739 --> 00:04:11,200
《95条论纲》是谁写的
Who wrote the 95 theses?

117
00:04:11,200 --> 00:04:13,380
我女儿一路过关斩将笑到最后
My daughter went on to win the whole thing,

118
00:04:13,380 --> 00:04:14,460
而我想到的就是
and all I could think was,

119
00:04:14,620 --> 00:04:16,540
我白白多花了4美元啊
"I just flushed $4 down the toilet."

120
00:04:16,540 --> 00:04:17,260
约翰·加尔文[正确答案是路德]
John Calvin.

121
00:04:18,240 --> 00:04:19,060
好样的 艾丽克斯
Whoo! Alex!

122
00:04:19,620 --> 00:04:21,620
我大概是没有想到
I guess I just didn't want to presume

123
00:04:21,620 --> 00:04:23,560
我们会在这里呆两天吧
that we would be here for the two days.

124
00:04:23,680 --> 00:04:25,020
但我要是租一天用的坐垫
But still, what kind of message

125
00:04:25,020 --> 00:04:26,632
那反映了什么心态啊
was I sending with the 1-dayer?

126
00:04:26,632 --> 00:04:27,900
你竟然说好样的
You "Whoo'd" Me?

127
00:04:27,900 --> 00:04:29,080
你在这儿干什么
What are you doing here?

128
00:04:29,160 --> 00:04:30,800
我出局了 我听错问题了
I'm out. I got the question wrong,

129
00:04:30,800 --> 00:04:32,568
那已经够尴尬了 你竟然还说我好样的
which is embarrassing enough without you "Whoo-ing" Me!

130
00:04:32,568 --> 00:04:34,638
艾丽克斯 艾丽克斯 回来 别走
Alex! Alex, come back here. Don't!

131
00:04:36,220 --> 00:04:36,680
想都别想
Don't!

132
00:04:38,960 --> 00:04:40,700
等等 最后四位数是什么再说一遍
Wait, what are the last four numbers again?

133
00:04:42,600 --> 00:04:44,000
对我来说算是个幸运数字了
It's kind of a lucky number for me.

134
00:04:44,040 --> 00:04:45,300
《浑身是劲》就是那年上映的
It's the year "Footloose" came out.

135
00:04:45,300 --> 00:04:47,880
是啊 我真想与你再赛一场
Oh, yeah. And I really am gonna call you for that rematch.

136
00:04:48,060 --> 00:04:50,280
随时随地 我是说 也别太晚
Anytime. I mean, not super late,

137
00:04:50,280 --> 00:04:51,600
但是 等等
But... Wait,

138
00:04:51,980 --> 00:04:52,740
你是斗牛犬队的
you're a bulldog?

139
00:04:52,860 --> 00:04:53,740
是啊 你呢
Yeah. You?

140
00:04:57,060 --> 00:04:59,600
我就知道我喜欢你某一点
I knew there was something about you I liked.

141
00:04:59,700 --> 00:05:01,380
你是说除了我让你赢这点之外吗
Oh, you mean besides me letting you win?

142
00:05:02,560 --> 00:05:04,040
今天有非常重要的一场比赛
You know, we have a big game today.

143
00:05:04,040 --> 00:05:05,097
想要一起看吗
You wanna watch it together?

144
00:05:06,519 --> 00:05:07,900
惨了 我的形体展示快迟到了
Shoot. I'm--I'm late for a showing.

145
00:05:07,900 --> 00:05:09,340
别有压力 如果你喜欢的话
No pressure at all, but if you feel like it,

146
00:05:09,340 --> 00:05:11,700
可以来我家一起看 我短信告诉你地址
we could watch it at my place. I could text you the address.

147
00:05:11,900 --> 00:05:12,960
好的 那谢谢了
All right. Well, thanks.

148
00:05:12,960 --> 00:05:14,260
见到你真高兴 菲尔
Hey, it was great meeting you, Phil.

149
00:05:14,260 --> 00:05:15,280
我也是 戴维
You, too, Dave.

150
00:05:19,540 --> 00:05:20,400
嘿 是我
Hey, it's me.

151
00:05:20,940 --> 00:05:22,560
你对这家健身房的说法完全正确
Yeah, you were totally right about this gym.

152
00:05:22,920 --> 00:05:24,300
我刚遇到一个超帅的男人
I just met the cutest guy.

153
00:05:24,520 --> 00:05:25,280
我跟你说过什么来着
What did I tell you?

154
00:05:25,340 --> 00:05:27,160
那地方就像个放了哑铃的Gay吧
That place is like a gay bar with dumbbells.

155
00:05:27,740 --> 00:05:28,140
真多余
Redundant.

156
00:05:28,540 --> 00:05:29,880
我还不太了解他
Well, I don't know much about him,

157
00:05:29,880 --> 00:05:31,100
但他邀请我去他家
but he invited me over to his place

158
00:05:31,100 --> 00:05:32,580
一起看橄榄球赛
o watch a football game tonight.

159
00:05:32,580 --> 00:05:33,480
老天啊 约会呀
Oh, my gosh, a date.

160
00:05:33,500 --> 00:05:35,160
我很看好你们哦
I have a good feeling about this.

161
00:05:35,320 --> 00:05:37,040
别这就开始计划婚礼了
Oh, well, don't start planning the wedding yet.

162
00:05:37,040 --> 00:05:39,320
我还不确定这是不是那种情侣约会
I mean, I'm not even sure if it's a date date.

163
00:05:39,400 --> 00:05:40,600
你和他在"约炮中心"相遇
You met him at hook-up central.

164
00:05:40,620 --> 00:05:41,840
当然是那种情侣约会了
Of course it's a date date.

165
00:05:41,920 --> 00:05:43,420
我准备好开始情侣约会了吗
Am I even ready for a date date?

166
00:05:43,420 --> 00:05:44,460
艰难的爱情时期 戴维
Tough love time, David--

167
00:05:44,640 --> 00:05:45,920
西蒙六个月前离开了你
Simon left you six months ago,

168
00:05:45,920 --> 00:05:46,980
你排斥所有人接近你
and you're bumming everyone out.

169
00:05:47,020 --> 00:05:48,720
现在是时候重返情场了
It's time to get back up on that horse.

170
00:05:48,980 --> 00:05:50,040
希望今晚能见到你 戴维
Hope to see you tonight, Dave.

171
00:05:50,960 --> 00:05:52,360
我都记不得上一次某个男人
I can't remember the last time

172
00:05:52,360 --> 00:05:53,840
对我这般狂吼是什么时候了
a man made that sound for me.

173
00:06:05,160 --> 00:06:07,280
她不在这 我们找错了成人礼派对
She's not here. We have the wrong bar mitzvah.

174
00:06:07,280 --> 00:06:09,099
如果你喜欢上等肋排就来对了 "奶奶"
Not if you like prime rib, bubbie.

175
00:06:09,380 --> 00:06:10,480
你说过要装得像一点
You said to blend.

176
00:06:10,480 --> 00:06:13,055
我在拿犹太糕点的时候顺便学了几个短语
I picked up some expressions at the latke station.

177
00:06:13,180 --> 00:06:14,940
对了 其实都是薯饼
P.S.--They're hash browns.

178
00:06:14,940 --> 00:06:15,900
我们不用装着融入了
We're not blending.

179
00:06:16,140 --> 00:06:17,280
她肯定在另外两个成人礼的其中之一上
She's at one of the other two.

180
00:06:17,420 --> 00:06:18,000
快点
Come on.

181
00:06:19,200 --> 00:06:20,220
抱歉
Oh. Sorry.

182
00:06:20,800 --> 00:06:22,260
那家伙真莽撞
Such a hurry, this one.

183
00:06:22,860 --> 00:06:23,620
快点
Come on.

184
00:06:26,360 --> 00:06:27,580
太可爱了
That is too cute.

185
00:06:27,740 --> 00:06:28,680
那是什么玩意儿
What the hell is that?

186
00:06:28,730 --> 00:06:31,760
那是商店的吉祥物 拥抱兔
Oh, that's the store mascot. That's hugga bunny.

187
00:06:31,760 --> 00:06:33,860
-他到处晃悠 拥抱 -行了 我知道
- He goes around and he hugs-- - No, I get it.

188
00:06:33,860 --> 00:06:34,920
流感季节到处抱"真好"
Nice for flu season.

189
00:06:35,500 --> 00:06:37,180
他应该叫结膜炎兔
He ought to be called conjunctivitis bunny.

190
00:06:38,140 --> 00:06:38,540
好吧
Okay.

191
00:06:38,540 --> 00:06:39,940
这样 爸爸
Uh, so, dad,

192
00:06:39,940 --> 00:06:41,740
婴儿床在那边 但既然我们在这边
The cribs are over there, but while we're here,

193
00:06:41,740 --> 00:06:43,980
给你个小建议 买多少连体衣都不嫌多
a little advice--you can never have too many onesies.

194
00:06:44,060 --> 00:06:45,660
任何场合 任何时间
All right? Any event, day or night.

195
00:06:45,900 --> 00:06:47,140
给宝宝套上一件 再穿上双袜袜
Throw one on, little pair of booties,

196
00:06:47,140 --> 00:06:48,294
就可以出发了
boom--ready to go out.

197
00:06:48,294 --> 00:06:49,726
把它穿在身上 显得很随意
Dress it up, you could dress it down.

198
00:06:49,726 --> 00:06:51,020
也可以...爸爸
You could--dad?

199
00:06:52,840 --> 00:06:53,240
爸
Dad?

200
00:06:54,340 --> 00:06:56,340
我爸明显有什么心事
Something was clearly going on with my dad,

201
00:06:56,340 --> 00:06:58,060
但我可不想瞎搀和
but I wasn't about to get sucked in.

202
00:06:58,160 --> 00:06:59,200
以前也发生过
It's happened before.

203
00:06:59,200 --> 00:07:01,880
"爸 你好像有些难过 能跟我说说吗"
"Dad, you seem sad. Do you wanna talk?"

204
00:07:01,880 --> 00:07:03,280
"说什么 我们什么关系 闺蜜吗"
"Talk?! What are we, girlfriends?"

205
00:07:04,620 --> 00:07:06,220
引用"运动"来解释
To use a sports reference,

206
00:07:06,220 --> 00:07:08,140
把橄榄球收起来吧 露西
put the football away, Lucy.

207
00:07:08,239 --> 00:07:09,991
我都没想踢
I ain't kickin'.

208
00:07:10,140 --> 00:07:11,220
那就周六中午
So Saturday noon?

209
00:07:11,220 --> 00:07:12,500
-周六中午可以 杰 -好的
- Saturday noon's fine, Jay. - Yeah.

210
00:07:12,500 --> 00:07:14,280
爸爸 我给你挑了一个尿片包
Hey, dad, I picked you up a diaper bag.

211
00:07:14,440 --> 00:07:16,140
有趣的设计在于 这个隔热袋
Fun fact-- this insulated pouch

212
00:07:16,140 --> 00:07:17,360
可以让一瓶普洛赛克酒保持冰凉
will keep a bottle of prosecco cold

213
00:07:17,360 --> 00:07:18,620
足以撑过整场儿童乐队表演
for an entire Wiggles concert.

214
00:07:19,140 --> 00:07:19,660
你好
Hi.

215
00:07:19,660 --> 00:07:22,200
-米奇 这位是 -鲍勃·詹森医生
- Uh, Mitch, it's doctor-- - Bob Jensen.

216
00:07:22,200 --> 00:07:23,020
很高兴见到你
Nice to meet you.

217
00:07:23,320 --> 00:07:24,420
杰 再见
Jay, I will see you.

218
00:07:24,440 --> 00:07:26,280
好的 到时候见 鲍勃
Yeah, I'll see you then. Good, Bob.

219
00:07:29,220 --> 00:07:30,500
医生 毛背心
Doctor? Sweater vest?

220
00:07:30,820 --> 00:07:32,060
我爸表现的很诡异
My dad acting all shifty?

221
00:07:32,360 --> 00:07:33,760
他在看心理医生
He was seeing a shrink.

222
00:07:34,360 --> 00:07:36,640
"爸爸 我看得出你在为什么事情煎熬"
"Dad, I can see that you're going through something."

223
00:07:36,660 --> 00:07:38,260
"我还能看见你胸罩带呢 奥普拉大妹子
"And I can see your bra strap, Oprah.

224
00:07:38,380 --> 00:07:39,380
管好自己的事儿吧"
Mind your own business."

225
00:07:41,440 --> 00:07:43,220
把那个橄榄球放好 露西
Tee up the football all you want, Lucy.

226
00:07:43,220 --> 00:07:45,299
我仍然没想踢
Still ain't kickin'.

227
00:07:45,360 --> 00:07:47,500
她显然听错了问题
She clearly misheard the question.

228
00:07:47,500 --> 00:07:49,860
这里的音响效果太差了
The acoustics in here are terrible.

229
00:07:49,860 --> 00:07:51,080
尤其对于一个耳朵发炎
Especially for a little girl

230
00:07:51,080 --> 00:07:53,060
-刚刚痊愈的小姑娘而言 -我的天
- just getting over an ear infection. - Oh, my god,

231
00:07:53,060 --> 00:07:53,860
你在干嘛
What are you doing?

232
00:07:53,860 --> 00:07:55,400
-我在为你解释 -我听到了
- I was explaining your-- - Oh, I heard,

233
00:07:55,400 --> 00:07:56,540
因为我耳朵没事
because my ears are fine.

234
00:07:56,620 --> 00:07:57,880
对不起 我没让她这么干
I'm sorry. I didn't ask her to do this.

235
00:07:57,880 --> 00:07:59,220
我是想帮你
I'm trying to help you.

236
00:07:59,220 --> 00:08:00,520
你不是想帮我 是想帮你自己
You were not. You were trying to help you.

237
00:08:00,520 --> 00:08:02,146
你生气是因为现在你不能像牵着小马驹一样
You're just mad because now you can't parade me around

238
00:08:02,146 --> 00:08:03,853
-拉着我到处展览了 -才不是这样的
- like some show pony. - That is not true.

239
00:08:03,853 --> 00:08:05,987
别抵赖了 你买的是2天用的垫子
Oh, don't deny it. You bought the 2-day cushion.

240
00:08:07,542 --> 00:08:09,025
你们有什么资格评判我
Who are you to judge?

241
00:08:22,398 --> 00:08:24,511
谢谢你带来的欢乐的一天 再见
Thank you for a fun day, okay? Good-bye.

242
00:08:24,511 --> 00:08:26,320
-现在就再见吗 -小卡 对不起
- Good-bye? - Ay, cam, sorry,

243
00:08:26,320 --> 00:08:27,640
可是午饭吃了两个小时
But the lunch was two hours,

244
00:08:27,700 --> 00:08:29,280
然后你又让我看你住过的第一间公寓
and then you had to show me your first apartment.

245
00:08:29,280 --> 00:08:31,420
你能相信我以前过着怎样的生活吗
Oh, could you believe how I used to live?

246
00:08:31,420 --> 00:08:32,880
我现在真得补个觉
I really need to take a nap now.

247
00:08:32,880 --> 00:08:35,020
不行不行不行
No. No, no. No. No. No, no. No, no.

248
00:08:35,020 --> 00:08:36,800
你知道吗 我有件事希望你去做
You know what? I have, uh, something I want you to do

249
00:08:36,800 --> 00:08:38,400
可比补觉更让人放松
that's even more relaxing than a nap.

250
00:08:38,400 --> 00:08:40,328
-真的 -不 我就想睡一会儿
- Yeah. - No. I want to take a nap.

251
00:08:42,140 --> 00:08:43,100
我"男人"来了
There's my man.

252
00:08:43,280 --> 00:08:44,640
我来了 你"男人"
That's me. Your man.

253
00:08:45,180 --> 00:08:47,260
我带来了菠菜酱 我也不知道为什么
I brought spinach dip. I don't know why.

254
00:08:47,260 --> 00:08:48,920
我告诉你为什么 因为它好吃
I'll tell you why. 'cause it's delicious,

255
00:08:48,920 --> 00:08:50,160
而且你是个好客人
and you're an awesome guest.

256
00:08:50,220 --> 00:08:51,220
-进来吧 -好啊
- Get in here. - All right.

257
00:08:51,220 --> 00:08:52,594
-你好吗 -还好 你呢
- How are you? - Good. You?

258
00:08:52,594 --> 00:08:53,860
还好 顺便说一下
Good. Uh, by the way,

259
00:08:53,860 --> 00:08:55,560
我给我小舅子和他爱人留了口信
I left a message for my brother-in-law and his partner

260
00:08:55,560 --> 00:08:56,400
让他们也过来
to join us, too.

261
00:08:56,640 --> 00:08:58,380
多一些人 好的
Oh, more people. Good.

262
00:08:59,020 --> 00:09:00,720
-房子不错 -谢谢
- Nice house, by the way. - Thanks.

263
00:09:02,340 --> 00:09:03,640
等一下 那是你的家人吗
Wait a minute. Is that your family?

264
00:09:04,380 --> 00:09:05,320
你结婚了吗
Are you married?

265
00:09:05,460 --> 00:09:07,240
是的 不过别担心 今晚家里都属于我们
Yeah, but don't worry. We have the house to ourselves.

266
00:09:07,280 --> 00:09:08,140
他们都出城去了
They're all out of town.

267
00:09:08,140 --> 00:09:10,600
我已经好久没过"男生之夜"了
I am long overdue for a boys' night.

268
00:09:10,600 --> 00:09:12,240
所以说 你妻子不介意...
Oh, so your wife is okay with--

269
00:09:12,240 --> 00:09:14,620
不介意 还是她提议的
Oh, yeah. She suggested it.

270
00:09:14,640 --> 00:09:16,280
她知道我偶尔需要跟男人们"玩玩"
She knows I need this every so often.

271
00:09:17,020 --> 00:09:18,620
只要我事后"清洗干净" 她没意见的
Long as I clean up afterwards, she's fine.

272
00:09:19,440 --> 00:09:20,560
你想喝一杯玛格丽特酒吗
You ready for a margarita?

273
00:09:20,900 --> 00:09:21,320
好的
Sure.

274
00:09:26,800 --> 00:09:27,620
静气凝神对不对
Soothing, right?

275
00:09:28,180 --> 00:09:30,000
你看 音乐让婴儿放松
You see, as the music relaxes the baby,

276
00:09:30,580 --> 00:09:31,400
你也放松了
you relax.

277
00:09:31,520 --> 00:09:33,800
才没 你让宝宝在我膀胱上跳呢
No, you're making the baby jump on my bladder.

278
00:09:34,180 --> 00:09:36,420
一首关于妓女的歌怎么能让人放松呢
How can it relax listening to a song about a hooker?

279
00:09:36,420 --> 00:09:38,140
她不是妓女 她是一名私人舞蹈家
She's not a hooker, she's a private dancer.

280
00:09:38,280 --> 00:09:39,180
她为钱而舞
A dancer for money.

281
00:09:39,220 --> 00:09:40,180
她会做任何你想让她做的事情...
She'll do what you want her to--

282
00:09:40,180 --> 00:09:41,917
我的天 我教过莉莉这首歌
Oh, my gosh, I taught lily this song.

283
00:09:42,780 --> 00:09:43,540
不好意思
Excuse me.

284
00:09:44,600 --> 00:09:45,040
喂
Hello?

285
00:09:45,160 --> 00:09:46,180
他已经结婚了
He's married.

286
00:09:46,180 --> 00:09:47,140
跟一个女人
To a woman.

287
00:09:47,199 --> 00:09:49,246
她外出了
Yeah, she's out of town.

288
00:09:49,460 --> 00:09:50,520
我不知道 他们估计是达成了
I don't know. They must have

289
00:09:50,520 --> 00:09:52,440
某种协议什么的
some sort of arrangement or something.

290
00:09:52,440 --> 00:09:53,820
那又怎样 若他们彼此心知肚明
So what? If they know about it,

291
00:09:53,820 --> 00:09:54,560
管那么多干嘛
who cares?

292
00:09:54,640 --> 00:09:56,100
反正你也还没准备好认真谈恋爱
You're not ready for a relationship anyway.

293
00:09:56,100 --> 00:09:57,160
玩玩而已嘛
Just have some fun.

294
00:09:57,360 --> 00:09:59,940
感觉好怪 他还邀请了其他人来
It feels weird. He has other people coming over.

295
00:09:59,960 --> 00:10:01,380
我觉得我还是走吧
I think I'm gonna bail on this.

296
00:10:01,540 --> 00:10:04,120
他是在试探你 就像你也在试探他一样
He's just feeling you out like you're feeling him out.

297
00:10:04,540 --> 00:10:07,240
放心吧 其他客人最后一定会神秘爽约
I promise you, these other guests will mysteriously cancel.

298
00:10:07,440 --> 00:10:08,760
稍等一下 亲爱的
Hold on just a second, sweetie.

299
00:10:09,740 --> 00:10:10,180
你好
Hello?

300
00:10:10,420 --> 00:10:11,580
你们还过来吗
Hey, you guys still coming?

301
00:10:12,060 --> 00:10:13,960
我忘了打给你 我们去不了了
Oh, I forgot to call you. We have to cancel.

302
00:10:14,100 --> 00:10:15,620
没关系 再见
No problem. Bye.

303
00:10:17,440 --> 00:10:18,520
我们有更多玛格丽塔酒喝了
More margaritas for us.

304
00:10:18,520 --> 00:10:19,951
其他客人刚刚说不过来了
The other guys just cancelled.

305
00:10:20,440 --> 00:10:21,420
你还在吗
Are you still there?

306
00:10:21,420 --> 00:10:24,340
你说对了 其他客人不来了
You were right. The other guys just cancelled.

307
00:10:24,340 --> 00:10:24,660
瞧吧
See?

308
00:10:24,760 --> 00:10:25,500
听我说
Now listen to me.

309
00:10:25,640 --> 00:10:26,640
你要喝两杯玛格丽塔酒
You're gonna have two margaritas.

310
00:10:26,980 --> 00:10:29,280
也许可以喝第三杯 他讲笑话你就笑
Maybe start a third. Laugh at his jokes.

311
00:10:29,520 --> 00:10:30,820
但笑声不能太尖
But not in that high falsetto thing.

312
00:10:30,840 --> 00:10:32,260
要有点男人的磁性 来练习一下
Something more manly. Let's practice.

313
00:10:32,420 --> 00:10:33,860
我才不要跟你练习笑声
Hey, I'm not gonna laugh for you.

314
00:10:33,860 --> 00:10:35,800
你有时控制欲太强了 你知道吗
You can be very controlling, you know that?

315
00:10:35,860 --> 00:10:37,820
为什么所有人都说我控制欲强
Why does everybody say I'm controlling?

316
00:10:37,980 --> 00:10:38,920
我得挂了
Oh. Gotta go.

317
00:10:40,260 --> 00:10:43,120
看来今晚寒舍只对斗牛犬人开放了
Looks like this kennel is for bulldogs only.

318
00:10:44,840 --> 00:10:45,480
你还好吗
You all right?

319
00:10:45,740 --> 00:10:47,320
没事 我很好
Yeah, I'm all right. I'm great.

320
00:10:47,420 --> 00:10:47,880
那就好
Oh, good.

321
00:10:47,880 --> 00:10:50,800
听着 我不想弄得很古怪
Listen, uh, I-I don't want this to sound weird,

322
00:10:50,800 --> 00:10:51,760
但是
But, um...

323
00:10:52,400 --> 00:10:57,240
但你和我 今晚 这算是...
But you and I, tonight... Is this, uh...

324
00:10:57,720 --> 00:10:58,720
抱歉 戴维 你说什么
Sorry, Dave, what was that?

325
00:11:00,060 --> 00:11:00,540
没什么
Nothing.

326
00:11:10,900 --> 00:11:11,780
给您
Here you go.

327
00:11:11,780 --> 00:11:13,720
只需交一点费用 我们就可以送货上门
For a small fee, we can come to your house

328
00:11:13,720 --> 00:11:14,640
并为您组装
and assemble it for you.

329
00:11:14,640 --> 00:11:16,540
我父亲比较习惯自己动手
Yeah, my dad's more of a do-it-yourself-er,

330
00:11:16,540 --> 00:11:18,760
而且他不喜欢让陌生人进他家
plus he's not one for strangers in his personal space.

331
00:11:19,000 --> 00:11:21,420
好吧 那我帮你搬到车上吧
All right. Uh, well, can I help you carry it to your car?

332
00:11:21,500 --> 00:11:22,880
那样他也不喜欢
Yeah, he's not gonna go for that, either.

333
00:11:23,060 --> 00:11:24,760
那家伙行李箱上有轮子都不用
The guy won't even use the wheels on his suitcase.

334
00:11:25,260 --> 00:11:27,140
他喜欢让别人觉得他是大块头猛男
Likes everyone to think he's this big, tough guy who--

335
00:11:27,140 --> 00:11:27,440
好吧
Okay.

336
00:11:28,300 --> 00:11:30,340
拿出来啦 好 开始干活吧
Yo! There he is. All right. Let's get this done.

337
00:11:30,740 --> 00:11:31,800
爸 其实
Hey, dad, you know--

338
00:11:31,800 --> 00:11:33,540
不 我们不需要别人帮忙 米奇尔
No, we don't need any help, Mitchell.

339
00:11:33,600 --> 00:11:34,600
把你那边举起来
Just pick up your end.

340
00:11:37,580 --> 00:11:38,780
爸 停一下 停一下
Dad, stop, stop, stop.

341
00:11:38,780 --> 00:11:39,840
怎么 刚抬就要休息吗
What? A break already?

342
00:11:39,980 --> 00:11:41,780
爸 你很明显有什么心事
Dad, you're obviously going through something.

343
00:11:42,060 --> 00:11:43,920
你不需要独自承受
Look, you do not have to go through this alone.

344
00:11:43,940 --> 00:11:45,100
我随时愿意倾听你的烦恼
I'm here to talk if you want.

345
00:11:46,162 --> 00:11:47,313
米奇尔 你人真好
That's really nice of you, Mitchell,

346
00:11:47,313 --> 00:11:48,907
但真的要在这里谈吗
But do you wanna do it here?

347
00:11:48,984 --> 00:11:50,600
因为我在那边看到一张小公主桌
'cause I saw a little princess table

348
00:11:50,600 --> 00:11:51,720
上面还有一套茶具
with a tea set on it.

349
00:11:51,720 --> 00:11:54,340
我们父子小闺蜜可以去那好好聊聊
You and I could have a real gab fest.

350
00:11:54,340 --> 00:11:56,600
我真是不长记性
Argh! I'm such a blockhead.

351
00:11:57,153 --> 00:11:58,946
我们能赶紧把这东西搬上车吗
Can't we just get this into the car?

352
00:11:58,946 --> 00:12:00,840
怎么 你怕去看心理医生迟到吗
Why? So you're not late for your shrink session?

353
00:12:00,840 --> 00:12:02,480
-什么 -是啊 我发现了
- What? - Yeah. I picked up on that.

354
00:12:02,480 --> 00:12:04,760
爱抱兔子的老头 那个我也看到了
Bunny hugger! Saw that, too.

355
00:12:04,840 --> 00:12:05,520
转玩具架的老头
Mobile spinner.

356
00:12:08,000 --> 00:12:09,960
老子对天发誓
I swear to god...

357
00:12:12,440 --> 00:12:14,400
你躲在这里做什么
What are you doing back here?!

358
00:12:14,720 --> 00:12:15,620
我没有房间钥匙
I didn't have the room key,

359
00:12:15,700 --> 00:12:17,120
也不想被任何人看到
and I don't want to be seen in public.

360
00:12:17,280 --> 00:12:19,360
我考虑了你刚才说的话
I thought about what you said before...

361
00:12:19,580 --> 00:12:20,700
中国的最后一位君主
When did China's last emperor

362
00:12:20,700 --> 00:12:22,240
-是在哪年登基的 -1909年
- ascend the throne? - 1909.

363
00:12:22,280 --> 00:12:24,320
你说我其它什么都行
And you can say a lot of things about me,

364
00:12:24,320 --> 00:12:26,380
但我不是那种把期望寄托在孩子身上的人
but I am not someone who lives through her kids.

365
00:12:26,460 --> 00:12:27,480
答错了 是1909年
Sorry. It's 1909.

366
00:12:27,900 --> 00:12:29,200
要问我喜不喜欢看到你成功
Do I like to see you succeed?

367
00:12:29,320 --> 00:12:30,220
我肯定喜欢
Of course I do!

368
00:12:30,300 --> 00:12:32,520
-氚是哪个元素的同位素 -氢
- Tritium is an isotope of what element? - Hydrogen.

369
00:12:32,520 --> 00:12:34,120
但要问我是否需要你的成功
But do I need that to

370
00:12:34,120 --> 00:12:35,740
来证明自己的价值
make myself feel important?

371
00:12:36,680 --> 00:12:37,260
那绝对不是
Absolutely not.

372
00:12:37,320 --> 00:12:38,480
错 答案是氢
No, the answer is hydrogen.

373
00:12:39,300 --> 00:12:40,760
说实在的 我真的有点寒心
As a matter of fact, I'm a little hurt

374
00:12:40,760 --> 00:12:41,960
你竟然认为我这么肤浅
you would think I was so shallow.

375
00:12:41,960 --> 00:12:45,060
波斯帝国的斯库德拉辖地包括哪两个区域
The Persian satrapy of Skudra included which two areas?

376
00:12:45,060 --> 00:12:46,100
马其顿和色雷斯
Macedonia and Thrace.

377
00:12:46,440 --> 00:12:49,380
我认识几个当妈的是那样 但我不是
I know moms like that, and that is not me.

378
00:12:49,900 --> 00:12:50,680
绝对不是
No way.

379
00:12:51,040 --> 00:12:52,120
马其顿和色雷斯
Macedonia and Thrace.

380
00:12:52,440 --> 00:12:53,920
开什么玩笑
Are you freaking kidding me?!

381
00:12:54,200 --> 00:12:56,980
马其顿和色雷斯 那是什么玩意
Macedonia and Thrace? What even is that?!

382
00:12:57,160 --> 00:12:59,980
你连听都没听 我们怎么会输的
You're hardly even listening! How could we lose this?!

383
00:13:01,720 --> 00:13:03,080
我居然说了"我们"
I said "We."

384
00:13:03,080 --> 00:13:04,520
是啊 你有时就这样
Yeah. You do that sometimes.

385
00:13:05,860 --> 00:13:06,640
我很抱歉
I'm so sorry.

386
00:13:07,440 --> 00:13:08,800
我就是那种妈妈
I am one of those moms.

387
00:13:09,600 --> 00:13:11,380
我很爱你赢的时候
I like it too much when you win.

388
00:13:11,780 --> 00:13:13,920
我好喜欢对其他妈耍威风
I really love lording it over the other moms.

389
00:13:15,320 --> 00:13:17,920
在我们家 你也只能指望拿我炫耀了
Well, in our house, I'm kind of your only source for that.

390
00:13:17,920 --> 00:13:19,385
那还用你说
You're telling me.

391
00:13:20,086 --> 00:13:22,390
海莉只会给我发她涂了指甲油的照片
Haley e-mails me pictures of her nails.

392
00:13:22,719 --> 00:13:24,938
卢克还问我他是不是有猫头鹰基因
And Luke asked me if he's part owl.

393
00:13:25,140 --> 00:13:26,660
他的头是挺能转的
He does get his head pretty far around.

394
00:13:27,280 --> 00:13:28,700
艾丽克斯 真对不起
Alex, I'm so sorry.

395
00:13:29,580 --> 00:13:30,320
没关系啦
It's okay.

396
00:13:31,180 --> 00:13:32,460
可能你是给我施加了点压力
Maybe you do put pressure on me,

397
00:13:32,460 --> 00:13:34,280
但我给自己的压力更大
but it's nothing compared to what I put on myself.

398
00:13:34,880 --> 00:13:37,220
我想我只是想为今天的事找个人来怪罪
I guess I needed somebody to blame for what happened today,

399
00:13:37,220 --> 00:13:38,360
而你恰好撞枪口上了
And there you were.

400
00:13:39,280 --> 00:13:40,800
你知道我很敬畏你的 对吧
You know I'm in awe of you, right?

401
00:13:43,040 --> 00:13:45,220
起来 我知道这地方的后门
Come on. I know a back way out of this place.

402
00:13:45,500 --> 00:13:46,640
等等 这东西你不打算还了吗
Wait. Don't you have to return that?

403
00:13:46,640 --> 00:13:48,580
才不 我可花了不少钱的
No way. I paid good money for this.

404
00:13:48,580 --> 00:13:50,798
-我们带着它去玩滑水道 -好吧
- We're taking it down the waterslide. -Okay.

405
00:13:50,798 --> 00:13:52,440
她居然也不在这里
How can she not be here, either?

406
00:13:52,440 --> 00:13:54,840
-我绝望了 -有点信心
- This is hopeless. - Have a little faith.

407
00:13:55,080 --> 00:13:57,320
埃及人把犹太人逼到红海边上的时候
Did the Jews give up when the Egyptians chased them

408
00:13:57,320 --> 00:13:58,420
他们放弃了吗
to the banks of the red sea?

409
00:13:58,660 --> 00:13:59,860
你是从哪儿知道这些的
How do you know all this stuff?

410
00:13:59,960 --> 00:14:02,540
难道就我一人听了曼纳汉姆叔叔的祝酒词吗
Was I the only one listening to uncle Menachem's toast?

411
00:14:02,740 --> 00:14:04,740
很高兴这对古犹太人管用
Well, I'm glad it worked out for the ancient Jews,

412
00:14:04,740 --> 00:14:05,360
但是眼下
But at the moment

413
00:14:05,360 --> 00:14:07,316
-我可没看见上帝怎么帮我了 -看
- I don't see God doing me any-- - Look!

414
00:14:16,232 --> 00:14:17,620
我不想让你难堪
I'm not gonna embarrass you,

415
00:14:17,620 --> 00:14:19,140
限你一分钟之内离开
but you got one minute to get out of here.

416
00:14:20,020 --> 00:14:20,700
你也是
You, too.

417
00:14:23,500 --> 00:14:24,640
就这样也挺好的
It's for the best.

418
00:14:24,640 --> 00:14:27,440
到处瞎转悠真让我有点劳累了
All this sneaking around was kind of weighing on me.

419
00:14:28,100 --> 00:14:30,120
-我们拿了礼物袋就走吧 -不
- Let's just grab our gift bags and go. - No.

420
00:14:30,280 --> 00:14:31,700
我还有50秒呢
I still have 50 seconds.

421
00:14:33,760 --> 00:14:34,560
打扰一下
Excuse me.

422
00:14:36,440 --> 00:14:36,840
你好
Hi.

423
00:14:37,360 --> 00:14:38,620
我叫曼尼·迪尔加多
My name is Manny Delgado,

424
00:14:38,620 --> 00:14:40,000
从你今天在大厅对我微笑后
And I've been searching for you

425
00:14:40,000 --> 00:14:41,640
我就一直在找你
since you smiled at me in the lobby today--

426
00:14:42,020 --> 00:14:43,400
或许我已经寻觅你一辈子了
Maybe even my whole life.

427
00:14:43,540 --> 00:14:46,060
我之前期待能与你一起共度良宵 但现在太晚了
It's too late for us to have the magical night I was hoping for,

428
00:14:46,060 --> 00:14:47,160
但有件事尚不算晚
but it's not too late for us

429
00:14:47,160 --> 00:14:48,620
那就是为错过的良宵留下美好的纪念
to have a memento of what might have been.

430
00:14:49,260 --> 00:14:50,000
我会等你
I'll be waiting.

431
00:15:02,380 --> 00:15:05,840
好了 米奇
Okay, Mitch--

432
00:15:05,920 --> 00:15:07,020
太迟了 不想听
Too late. Not interested.

433
00:15:08,600 --> 00:15:09,220
给我听着
Now listen.

434
00:15:10,074 --> 00:15:11,508
我就不信了 我去开后门
Okay, you know what? I'm just gonna go out the back.

435
00:15:11,508 --> 00:15:13,807
车门和天窗都锁了
Door, sunroof-- all on lockdown.

436
00:15:16,160 --> 00:15:18,400
行了 听着 你今天看见的那个人
Okay, look, that guy you met today--

437
00:15:18,400 --> 00:15:19,280
他是个心理医生
he is a shrink.

438
00:15:19,560 --> 00:15:20,980
但我并不怎么去
But I don't see him all the time.

439
00:15:21,160 --> 00:15:24,040
你妈和我在离婚前去了几次
You mom and I saw him a little before the divorce.

440
00:15:24,160 --> 00:15:26,520
但有时我碰到了点什么事
But every now and then, something comes up for me,

441
00:15:26,520 --> 00:15:27,980
我也会去他那调整一下
and I go in for a tune-up.

442
00:15:28,940 --> 00:15:30,920
如果你是在等我问你 最近怎么了
If you're waiting for me to ask what's going on with you,

443
00:15:30,920 --> 00:15:32,140
那你还是别等了
you just better keep waiting,

444
00:15:32,140 --> 00:15:34,087
因为我不想再自讨没趣
'cause I learned my lesson.

445
00:15:34,087 --> 00:15:35,160
我为某件事心情不怎么好
I'm down about something--

446
00:15:35,160 --> 00:15:36,560
我知道这事迟早要来
something I knew was coming,

447
00:15:37,120 --> 00:15:38,720
现在终于来了
and now it's finally happening.

448
00:15:40,360 --> 00:15:43,560
我的办公室今天就要变成婴儿房了
We're turning my office into the nursery today.

449
00:15:45,320 --> 00:15:47,960
你一副打了败仗般的悲伤抑郁神情
You've been moping around like you lost your platoon

450
00:15:47,960 --> 00:15:49,580
-就为了一个房间 -不止是房间的问题
- over a room? - Not just a room.

451
00:15:50,540 --> 00:15:52,100
整个家里也就在那间房
It's the only place in this house

452
00:15:52,100 --> 00:15:55,040
我能关上门读本书或喝杯酒了
where I can still close the door and read a book or have a drink.

453
00:15:55,120 --> 00:15:56,640
只有那个房间是完全属于我的
Everything in there was mine.

454
00:15:57,360 --> 00:15:59,140
谁在乎 每个人都有烦心事
Ah, who cares? Everybody's got their problems.

455
00:15:59,560 --> 00:15:59,860
不
No.

456
00:16:02,516 --> 00:16:04,109
我这边的门还是能开的
You know, I can still open my door.

457
00:16:04,109 --> 00:16:06,072
你只是把你自己反锁了
You just locked yourself back in.

458
00:16:08,000 --> 00:16:09,460
听着 爸 我...
Look, dad, I...

459
00:16:09,460 --> 00:16:12,120
我之前也为莉莉的卧室放弃了我的家庭办公室
I had to give up my home office for Lily's bedroom,

460
00:16:12,120 --> 00:16:14,200
我对此也很伤心
and I was upset about it, too.

461
00:16:15,050 --> 00:16:16,260
没到要抱兔宝宝的地步 但也...
Wasn't hugging bunnies, but...

462
00:16:16,260 --> 00:16:17,040
行了你
All right.

463
00:16:17,040 --> 00:16:21,750
我 我意识到这不是办公室或房间的问题
I-I realize that it wasn't about an office or a room.

464
00:16:21,750 --> 00:16:24,560
而是莉莉将要带来的全面改变
It was about how Lily was gonna change everything.

465
00:16:24,560 --> 00:16:26,800
但我们一接她到家
But once we got her in there,

466
00:16:27,208 --> 00:16:29,248
我不知道 我 我就 不再想那事了
I don't know. I-I just-- I never looked back.

467
00:16:31,120 --> 00:16:33,320
是啊 我想我可能就是对现状有点紧张
Yeah, I guess I'm just nervous about everything, you know.

468
00:16:33,320 --> 00:16:36,254
-是啊 -谢谢你 孩子
- Yeah. - Thanks, kid.

469
00:16:37,420 --> 00:16:39,180
知道不 我忽然想起来
You know, I'm just recalling

470
00:16:39,180 --> 00:16:41,580
你和克莱尔快要出生的时候
me grumbling about giving up my MG roadster

471
00:16:41,580 --> 00:16:42,920
我要放弃那名爵跑车也很是不爽
when you and Claire came along.

472
00:16:43,120 --> 00:16:46,020
那车超酷 没后座呢
Great car. No backseat.

473
00:16:46,500 --> 00:16:48,160
想起来真是有趣 我们认为最愚蠢的事...
Isn't it funny? The stupid things that we think--

474
00:16:48,160 --> 00:16:52,167
-她是我的小宝贝 -如此重要
- She was my baby. - are so important.

475
00:16:52,486 --> 00:16:54,693
我想算下来 我们总共有50只鸡
I guess all told, we had about 50 chickens.

476
00:16:54,693 --> 00:16:56,980
差不多115头猪
Maybe 115 head of hogs.

477
00:16:57,020 --> 00:16:58,080
大概 55头牛
Let's see, 55 cattle.

478
00:16:58,080 --> 00:16:59,160
哎呀你知道怎么样才好玩吗
Oh, you know what'll be fun?

479
00:16:59,160 --> 00:17:01,600
我想想还记不记得它们的名字 有...
Let's see if I can remember all their names. There was...

480
00:17:01,600 --> 00:17:03,200
艾尔伯特 莉莎
Albert, Lisa

481
00:17:03,200 --> 00:17:04,740
斯特夫和麦克
Steph, and Mike

482
00:17:04,740 --> 00:17:05,700
歌洛莉亚 别走 歌洛莉亚
Gloria! No, Gloria!

483
00:17:06,280 --> 00:17:06,600
歌洛莉亚
Gloria!

484
00:17:07,380 --> 00:17:11,000
不 我一个故事都不想再听了
No. I do not want to hear one more story.

485
00:17:11,080 --> 00:17:12,640
我现在要去小睡一会儿
I am going to take a nap now.

486
00:17:12,640 --> 00:17:14,180
好的 当然了 悉听尊便
Okay, yeah, sure. Whatever you want.

487
00:17:14,180 --> 00:17:15,391
今天你说了算
This day's about you.

488
00:17:15,680 --> 00:17:17,640
-只是有一件事 -别再有事了
- Just one more thing-- - No, no one more thing!

489
00:17:17,900 --> 00:17:19,120
我只是想拍张照片
I just wanted to take a picture, you know,

490
00:17:19,120 --> 00:17:20,280
以此纪念我们这么特殊的一天
To commemorate our special day.

491
00:17:20,400 --> 00:17:21,820
好吧 你要照就照吧
Okay, fine! Take the picture!

492
00:17:21,910 --> 00:17:24,060
不 这里不行 光线太差
No, not here. The lighting's terrible.

493
00:17:24,060 --> 00:17:25,520
我想可以在
I was thinking we could take it...

494
00:17:25,520 --> 00:17:26,580
新的婴儿房里拍
in your new nursery!

495
00:17:30,780 --> 00:17:32,400
不 小卡 不
No, Cam. No.

496
00:17:32,540 --> 00:17:33,680
但是 歌洛莉亚 过来...
But, Gloria, come--

497
00:17:33,680 --> 00:17:35,580
必须有人点醒你 你这样不行
Somebody has to tell you this. No.

498
00:17:35,800 --> 00:17:38,700
你想掌控一切 你想掌控别人的生活
You try to control everything. You take over people's lives!

499
00:17:39,300 --> 00:17:41,900
你这个人总是那么过火
It's always too much with you!

500
00:17:41,900 --> 00:17:43,765
也许我们应该在外面走廊上谈这个
You know, maybe we should talk about this out in the hallway.

501
00:17:43,765 --> 00:17:45,800
为什么 因为外面光线更好吗
Why, because there's gonna be better lighting over there?

502
00:17:45,800 --> 00:17:48,440
你又这样 小卡 你又这样
You're doing it again, Cam. You're doing it again!

503
00:17:50,860 --> 00:17:52,300
你说得对 我太过火了
You're right. I am too much.

504
00:17:52,360 --> 00:17:53,900
我是控制狂 我喜欢干预别人
I do control. I do barge.

505
00:17:54,180 --> 00:17:56,380
我会叫我朋友阿伯拉德回来把这个涂掉
I'll have my friend Abelard come back and paint over it.

506
00:17:56,760 --> 00:17:59,040
你把我整天拖在外面就为了这个吗
So this is why you kept me outside all day?

507
00:17:59,040 --> 00:18:02,940
好让你的朋友阿拉伯什么的来画这个礼物
So that your friend Aburar could come and paint a present?

508
00:18:02,940 --> 00:18:04,900
是啊 我怎么不能像正常人一样从你的
Yeah, rather than getting you a gift off your registry

509
00:18:04,900 --> 00:18:05,880
礼物登记簿中选一样呢
like a normal person.

510
00:18:05,980 --> 00:18:08,060
-我好蠢 -我爱死了
- I'm so stupid. - I love it!

511
00:18:08,600 --> 00:18:09,340
真的吗
You do?

512
00:18:09,500 --> 00:18:11,000
那画就和你一样
It's just like you--

513
00:18:11,160 --> 00:18:14,834
丰富多彩 生机勃勃 超级有爱
Full of color... And life... And love.

514
00:18:15,420 --> 00:18:17,060
我真心觉得你会喜欢的
I really did think you'd love it.

515
00:18:17,160 --> 00:18:18,380
什么情况
What's going on up here?

516
00:18:19,560 --> 00:18:22,520
-靠 -那不是我的主意 我告诉过小卡
- What the... - Okay, that was not my idea. I told Cam--

517
00:18:22,620 --> 00:18:24,260
我告诉他这样在人家墙上乱涂太过分了
I told him that's a lot to put on someone's wall.

518
00:18:24,320 --> 00:18:26,520
等下 我喜欢
Hold on. I like it.

519
00:18:26,620 --> 00:18:28,720
-真的吗 -多谢 小卡
- Really? Oh... - Thanks, Cam.

520
00:18:29,020 --> 00:18:30,700
-你真的... -现在放弃这房间容易多了
- You actually-- - Makes it easier to give up the room.

521
00:18:38,380 --> 00:18:40,220
就差那么一点儿[太近了]
Wow, that's close.

522
00:18:41,160 --> 00:18:42,500
那家伙就出界了一点儿
Guy was an inch out of bounds.

523
00:18:47,720 --> 00:18:48,700
暂停[够了]
Time-out.

524
00:18:50,660 --> 00:18:51,800
知道吗
You know what?

525
00:18:51,975 --> 00:18:53,860
不把这事儿"搞定"
I'm not gonna be able to relax

526
00:18:53,860 --> 00:18:55,260
我没法真心乐起来
until I get this out of the way.

527
00:18:58,880 --> 00:18:59,500
洗碗机
Dishwasher.

528
00:19:01,140 --> 00:19:02,260
超酷的吧
Pretty cool, huh?

529
00:19:03,360 --> 00:19:05,060
是啊 的确是
Yeah. It is.

530
00:19:06,280 --> 00:19:07,620
你可以
Hey, do you think...

531
00:19:07,980 --> 00:19:08,640
再帮我倒一杯吗
mind if I freshen this?

532
00:19:08,640 --> 00:19:09,880
没问题 我来吧
Yeah, yeah, yeah. Allow me.

533
00:19:11,020 --> 00:19:12,540
哇 你的手在发抖
Wow. Your hand's shaking.

534
00:19:13,780 --> 00:19:16,520
记住咯 戴维 只是比赛[游戏]而已
Remember, Dave, it's just a game.

535
00:19:20,788 --> 00:19:24,856
我的天 我的天
Oh, god! Oh, my god! my gosh.

536
00:19:24,856 --> 00:19:27,184
-我来擦 -没事的
- Oh, come here. - It's all right.

537
00:19:27,184 --> 00:19:29,260
-有点湿罢了 -不 你都湿透了
- I'm--I'm just a little wet. - Oh, no, you're drenched.

538
00:19:29,260 --> 00:19:30,780
你这样没法坐 不如
You can't sit in that. You know what?

539
00:19:31,020 --> 00:19:32,830
脱掉吧 我扔到烘干机里
Take that off. I'll throw 'em both in the dryer

540
00:19:32,830 --> 00:19:34,230
我去拿两件干净的
and get us a couple of clean ones.

541
00:19:34,610 --> 00:19:35,170
好的
Okay.

542
00:19:35,970 --> 00:19:38,510
我猜反正也总是要脱的
Well, I guess this is something we're doing.

543
00:19:39,370 --> 00:19:39,730
断球
Interception!

544
00:19:40,890 --> 00:19:41,230
断球
Interception!

545
00:19:41,930 --> 00:19:43,190
-加油 伙计 -加油
- Come on, buddy! - Come on!

546
00:19:43,190 --> 00:19:44,316
-加油 伙计 -加油
- Come on, buddy! - Come on!

547
00:19:44,316 --> 00:19:47,149
加油 伙计 触地得分
Come on! Come on, buddy! Touchdown!

548
00:19:48,190 --> 00:19:50,010
真是太兴奋了
How exciting is this?!

549
00:19:50,010 --> 00:19:51,490
人家都等了好久了
Oh, it's been so long.

550
00:19:52,546 --> 00:19:54,958
-怎么了 -没什么
- What's happening? - Uhh. Nothing.

551
00:19:54,958 --> 00:19:56,170
是我的车钥匙"顶"到你
Oh, my car keys.

552
00:19:56,170 --> 00:19:57,950
见鬼 电视挂了
Shoot. The TV went off.

553
00:19:58,250 --> 00:19:59,930
肯定是什么"搞"坏了
Must have screwed something up.

554
00:19:59,930 --> 00:20:01,310
知道吗 没关系
You know what? It doesn't matter.

555
00:20:01,410 --> 00:20:02,410
楼上还有电视
There's another one upstairs.

556
00:20:02,830 --> 00:20:04,090
不如我们上楼去卧室
How about we head up to the bedroom

557
00:20:04,090 --> 00:20:05,670
来个中场"狂欢"
for some halftime festivities?

558
00:20:06,410 --> 00:20:08,290
那 好吧
Oh... Okay.

559
00:20:08,570 --> 00:20:09,750
我们"上"吧
Let's do this.

560
00:20:14,319 --> 00:20:16,230
我都忘了这样有多开心了
I'd forgotten how much fun this can be.

561
00:20:16,230 --> 00:20:17,830
我们应该定期聚下
We should make this a regular thing.

562
00:20:18,050 --> 00:20:19,310
菲尔 菲尔 等等
Phil, Phil, wait.

563
00:20:19,571 --> 00:20:22,025
我想我还是回家好了
Uh, I think I'd better just head home.

564
00:20:22,350 --> 00:20:25,510
-什么 -我刚结束一段长期恋情
- What? - I'm just coming out of a long-term relationship,

565
00:20:25,510 --> 00:20:27,710
我觉得我现在内心依然脆弱
and I guess I'm still pretty fragile.

566
00:20:27,930 --> 00:20:30,557
不是说我玩得不开心
It's not that I haven't had a-a great time.

567
00:20:30,557 --> 00:20:31,830
没关系 我懂的
Not at all. Hey, I get it.

568
00:20:31,830 --> 00:20:33,570
我也曾经有过肝肠寸断的几晚
I've spent a few nights in heartbreak hotel.

569
00:20:34,170 --> 00:20:35,710
如果有我能帮得上的
If there's anything I can do...

570
00:20:37,050 --> 00:20:39,110
你对我的帮助比你想像的大得多
You've already done more than you know.
